{"unit":{"id":"l1-u08","level":1,"order":8,"title":"This & That","wordIds":["w:这","w:那","w:个","w:什么","w:哪","w:多少","w:几","w:这些","w:那些","w:一些","w:有些","w:哪些"],"grammarIds":["g:shenme-question","g:er-vs-liang","g:mingzi-name","g:duoshao-question"],"sentenceIds":["s:l1:006","s:l1:020","s:l1:026","s:l1:028","s:l1:110","s:l1:061","s:l1:098","s:l1:108","s:l1:115","s:l1:120","s:l1:121","s:l1:025","s:l1:099","s:l1:002","s:l1:027","s:l1:219","s:l1:064","s:l1:072"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:shenme-question","title":"Asking with 什么 (\"what\")","pattern":"... + 什么 (+ object)?","explanation":"什么 (shénme) means \"what\". It stays in the position where the answer would go, rather than moving to the front of the sentence the way English \"what\" does. 你看什么? literally means \"you look-at what?\"","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:025","s:l1:026","s:l1:027","s:l1:028"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"g:er-vs-liang","title":"二 vs 两 for the number two","pattern":"两 + measure word / 二 in counting and labels","explanation":"Both 二 (èr) and 两 (liǎng) mean \"two\", but they aren't interchangeable. Use 两 before a measure word like 个 when counting things (两个), and use 二 for counting in sequence, dates, and labels like 二月 (February) or 第二 (second).","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:108","s:l1:109","s:l1:110","s:l1:111"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"g:mingzi-name","title":"Asking someone's name with 名字","pattern":"叫 + 什么 + 名字?","explanation":"你叫什么名字? (\"What's your name?\") is the standard way to ask a name, combining 叫 (\"to be called\") with 名字 (\"name\"). 名字 can also stand on its own as a noun, as in 他的名字 (\"his name\").","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:120","s:l1:121","s:l1:122","s:l1:123"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"g:duoshao-question","title":"多少 for \"how many/how much\"","pattern":"多少 + (measure word) + noun?","explanation":"多少 (duōshao) asks about quantity, especially larger numbers, prices, or amounts: 多少钱? (\"How much money?\"). Unlike 几, 多少 doesn't require a measure word before the noun, though one can still be added.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:096","s:l1:097","s:l1:098","s:l1:099"],"unitId":"l1-u08"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l1:006","zh":"你在这。","pinyin":"Nǐ zài zhè.","en":"You are here.","wordIds":["w:你","w:在","w:这"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:020","zh":"我给你一个。","pinyin":"Wǒ gěi nǐ yí gè.","en":"I'll give you one.","wordIds":["w:我","w:给","w:你","w:一","w:个"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:026","zh":"他说什么？","pinyin":"Tā shuō shénme?","en":"What did he say?","wordIds":["w:他","w:说","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:028","zh":"你看什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ kàn shénme?","en":"What are you looking at?","wordIds":["w:你","w:看","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:110","zh":"他有两个。","pinyin":"Tā yǒu liǎng gè.","en":"He has two.","wordIds":["w:他","w:有","w:两","w:个"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:061","zh":"他叫什么？","pinyin":"Tā jiào shénme?","en":"What's he called?","wordIds":["w:他","w:叫","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:098","zh":"你要多少？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào duōshao?","en":"How much do you want?","wordIds":["w:你","w:要","w:多少"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:108","zh":"我有两个儿子。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng gè érzi.","en":"I have two sons.","wordIds":["w:我","w:有","w:两","w:个","w:儿子"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:115","zh":"你要几杯？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào jǐ bēi?","en":"How many cups do you want?","wordIds":["w:你","w:要","w:几","w:杯"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:120","zh":"你叫什么名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","en":"What's your name?","wordIds":["w:你","w:叫","w:什么","w:名字"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:121","zh":"他叫什么名字？","pinyin":"Tā jiào shénme míngzi?","en":"What's his name?","wordIds":["w:他","w:叫","w:什么","w:名字"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:025","zh":"你想做什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ xiǎng zuò shénme?","en":"What do you want to do?","wordIds":["w:你","w:想","w:做","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:099","zh":"你想要多少个？","pinyin":"Nǐ xiǎng yào duōshao gè?","en":"How many would you like?","wordIds":["w:你","w:想","w:要","w:多少","w:个"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:002","zh":"我有这个。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu zhège.","en":"I have this one.","wordIds":["w:我","w:有","w:这","w:个"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:027","zh":"这是什么？","pinyin":"Zhè shì shénme?","en":"What is this?","wordIds":["w:这","w:是","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:219","zh":"这个不大。","pinyin":"Zhège bú dà.","en":"This isn't very big.","wordIds":["w:这","w:个","w:不","w:大"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:064","zh":"这个叫什么？","pinyin":"Zhège jiào shénme?","en":"What is this called?","wordIds":["w:这","w:个","w:叫","w:什么"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:072","zh":"请看这个。","pinyin":"Qǐng kàn zhège.","en":"Please look at this.","wordIds":["w:请","w:看","w:这","w:个"],"unitId":"l1-u08"}]}
